{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29458","headline":"碧城三首 一 · 李商隐","name":"碧城三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧城十二曲阑干，犀辟尘埃玉辟寒。\n阆苑有书多附鹤，女牀无树不栖鸾。\n星沉海底当窗见，雨过河源隔座看。\n若是晓珠明又定，一生长树水晶盘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29458.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29458","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗鼓吹》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩鼔吹_(四庫全書本)）"}